category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Read and write Gwyddion GWY files (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Libgwyfile is a small, embeddable library for reading and writing of Gwyddion
GWY files as foreign data. This means independently of Gwyddon and without
adopting its data object model."
